---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-09-06';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How PetWellHub discloses affiliate links and separates commercial relationships from veterinary guidance">
  <article class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24"><header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">Legal · Affiliate</p><h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-bold md:text-7xl">Affiliate Disclosure</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
      <section><h2>What an affiliate link means</h2><p>Some PetWellHub pages may contain links that can generate a commission if a reader completes a qualifying purchase. A qualifying commission ordinarily does not change the price charged by the merchant.</p></section>
      <section><h2>How links are identified</h2><p>When a page contains an affiliate relationship, the disclosure should appear near the recommendation or before the affected link. The merchant, not PetWellHub, controls price, availability, shipping, returns, warranties, and customer service.</p></section>
      <section><h2>No claim of hands-on testing</h2><p>An affiliate link does not mean PetWellHub bought, used, tested, or clinically evaluated the product. Product discussion should distinguish official specifications and published evidence from direct experience.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Veterinary decisions remain separate</h2><p>Commercial relationships do not determine medication, diet, parasite prevention, emergency care, or other veterinary decisions. Ask the treating veterinarian whether a product is appropriate for the individual animal.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Questions</h2><p>Questions about a disclosure may be sent to <a class="underline" href="mailto:editor@petwellhub.org">editor@petwellhub.org</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
